l factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{12}{|4 x|\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "be5a94b0-c15c-5245-809f-87ec32d06a0a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "be5a94b0-c15c-5245-809f-87ec32d06a0a" :question/answer-fields "5a8bf52d-713c-5b03-98ae-fa4faa24c699"] [:db/ensure "be5a94b0-c15c-5245-809f-87ec32d06a0a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "be5a94b0-c15c-5245-809f-87ec32d06a0a"] [:db/add "0ea1e8ac-b0c3-504e-b815-134004170169" :answer/id #uuid "0ea1e8ac-b0c3-504e-b815-134004170169"] [:db/add "0ea1e8ac-b0c3-504e-b815-134004170169" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0ea1e8ac-b0c3-504e-b815-134004170169" :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "0ea1e8ac-b0c3-504e-b815-134004170169" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3e8ea61c-a1a2-5e6e-9613-37c67c541502" :answer/id #uuid "3e8ea61c-a1a2-5e6e-9613-37c67c541502"] [:db/add "3e8ea61c-a1a2-5e6e-9613-37c67c541502" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3e8ea61c-a1a2-5e6e-9613-37c67c541502" :answer/value "2 x+C"] [:db/ensure "3e8ea61c-a1a2-5e6e-9613-37c67c541502" :answer/validate] [:db/add "97eb90ad-d975-5850-ac7e-aa9fe4ee2022" :answer/id #uuid "97eb90ad-d975-5850-ac7e-aa9fe4ee2022"] [:db/add "97eb90ad-d975-5850-ac7e-aa9fe4ee2022" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "97eb90ad-d975-5850-ac7e-aa9fe4ee2022" :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "97eb90ad-d975-5850-ac7e-aa9fe