4}{|2 x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "e6e0e61d-ead6-5f19-bceb-11e220eb1b21" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{|2 x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e6e0e61d-ead6-5f19-bceb-11e220eb1b21" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e6e0e61d-ead6-5f19-bceb-11e220eb1b21" :question/answer-fields "5efcfe9d-fcdf-579d-b48d-d4933d642799"] [:db/ensure "e6e0e61d-ead6-5f19-bceb-11e220eb1b21" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "e6e0e61d-ead6-5f19-bceb-11e220eb1b21"] [:db/add "41153a47-2c22-51b1-93d0-1d9c520d4f42" :answer/id #uuid "41153a47-2c22-51b1-93d0-1d9c520d4f42"] [:db/add "41153a47-2c22-51b1-93d0-1d9c520d4f42" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "41153a47-2c22-51b1-93d0-1d9c520d4f42" :answer/value "2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(8 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "41153a47-2c22-51b1-93d0-1d9c520d4f42" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f84ed405-4aa8-5d4b-9ce1-29721892030e" :answer/id #uuid "f84ed405-4aa8-5d4b-9ce1-29721892030e"] [:db/add "f84ed405-4aa8-5d4b-9ce1-29721892030e" :answer/type