 x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "ad157451-4a62-57a4-bcde-1653a254282e" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $9\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=3$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{9}{|3 x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "ad157451-4a62-57a4-bcde-1653a254282e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "ad157451-4a62-57a4-bcde-1653a254282e" :question/answer-fields "e0a71231-20e7-512e-8a12-55ac2c1d164c"] [:db/ensure "ad157451-4a62-57a4-bcde-1653a254282e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "ad157451-4a62-57a4-bcde-1653a254282e"] [:db/add "9fd2bd12-98e8-5452-b552-16067f1bec47" :answer/id #uuid "9fd2bd12-98e8-5452-b552-16067f1bec47"] [:db/add "9fd2bd12-98e8-5452-b552-16067f1bec47" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9fd2bd12-98e8-5452-b552-16067f1bec47" :answer/value "3 x+C"] [:db/ensure "9fd2bd12-98e8-5452-b552-16067f1bec47" :answer/validate] [:db/add "24031b1d-7c1e-5bd1-ac16-6088212e9a7e" :answer/id #uuid "24031b1d-7c1e-5bd1-ac16-6088212e9a7e"] [:db/add "24031b1d-7c1e-5bd1-ac16-6088212e9a7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "24031b1d-7c1e-5bd