"9f1ebdc5-5509-5781-8317-a71a1260f3ff" :answer-field/choices "0dc7c2f3-9b36-5016-8113-2310589be873"] [:db/add "9f1ebdc5-5509-5781-8317-a71a1260f3ff" :answer-field/correct "ccc371fc-82bc-5b98-9008-6b8d67c5451b"] [:db/ensure "9f1ebdc5-5509-5781-8317-a71a1260f3ff" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1d1fee3e-68aa-596e-91bf-64b8812f78c3" :question/id #uuid "1d1fee3e-68aa-596e-91bf-64b8812f78c3"] [:db/add "1d1fee3e-68aa-596e-91bf-64b8812f78c3" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{6}{|3 x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "1d1fee3e-68aa-596e-91bf-64b8812f78c3" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $6\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{6}{|3 x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "1d1fee3e-68aa-596e-91bf-64b8812f78c3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "1d1fee3e-68aa-596e-91bf-64b8812f78c3" :question/answer-fields "9f1ebdc5-5509-5781-8317-a71a1260f3ff"] [:db/ensure "1d1fee3e-68aa-596e-91bf-64b8812f78c3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "1d1fee3e-68aa-596e-91bf-64b8812f78c3"] [:db/add "04388f6f-3e25-55ac