tiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "d38b0853-7e2b-521b-8dc7-fbd647a3dc44" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{3}{2}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{|2 x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "d38b0853-7e2b-521b-8dc7-fbd647a3dc44" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "d38b0853-7e2b-521b-8dc7-fbd647a3dc44" :question/answer-fields "50a83a65-815e-58d7-b708-4973c1990c19"] [:db/ensure "d38b0853-7e2b-521b-8dc7-fbd647a3dc44" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "d38b0853-7e2b-521b-8dc7-fbd647a3dc44"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "c8638026-59da-50cd-b1d8-68a86000b2a6"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/26/265d7d78ebb6cbd04b022156e2d7790ca249a9218a9a5bfc29f5422dbd15471a/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/validate] [:db/cas 17592186680063 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186680106 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186680118 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186680136 :question/retired nil true] [:db